      "description": "A daily pause to recenter your life in Jesus Christ.\n\nLife is full of noise and responsibilities. Little Light helps you make a little room for spiritual nourishment, with short gospel lessons that connect scripture to everyday life.\n\nRead a clear explanation, reflect on a meaningful question and carry one simple thought into your day.\n\n• Choose lessons for grown-ups, teens and young adults, or children.\n• Explore scripture through relatable insights and practical applications.\n• Set optional reminders to pause during your routine.\n• Save favorite lessons and write your own quiet thoughts.\n• Read along with family and friends, then share what stood out.\n\nEach audience has its own daily reading sequence, beginning November 14, 2026. This edition includes 365 lessons for children, 365 for teens and young adults, and 377 for grown-ups. Earlier readings in this edition remain available in Past days.\n\nRooted in the Bible, Book of Mormon, Doctrine and Covenants, and Pearl of Great Price.\n\nOne purchase includes all three audiences. No subscription or in-app purchases.\n\nCreated by Brad Devine. Little Light is an independent gospel companion and is not affiliated with, sponsored by or endorsed by The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints.",
